Given the following code:

```php
        try {
            $obj = new HeavyClass();
        } catch (RuntimeException $r) {
            throw $r;
        }
```

currently remove the assign:

```diff
-      $obj = new HeavyClass();
```

which it may have sideeffect, so the only removed should be only the variable, not the assign:

```diff
-     $obj = new HeavyClass();
+.    new HeavyClass();
```

